config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_TASMOTICZ
	bool "Domoticz plugin: Tasmoticz"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_REQUESTS
	default n
	help
		expose the Tasmota devices of an MQTT broker in Domoticz, with automatic configuration and sync commands (it ships its own MQTT client and the Tasmota support).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/Tasmoticz, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> Tasmoticz, enter the MQTT broker and the Tasmota topic prefix.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
